cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the accompanying manuscript and identify the release tag or commit used."
type: software
title: "PlaneWave: formalised discretisation error bounds for Coulomb quantum simulation"
authors:
  - family-names: Berry
    given-names: Dominic W.
version: 1.0.0
abstract: >-
  Lean formalisation of periodic Coulomb ground-energy, spatial-grid, dynamical,
  kinetic-energy and projection-flux error estimates, with free-boundary energy
  comparisons and spin-inclusive Born-Oppenheimer and non-Born-Oppenheimer dynamics
  under the stated regularity and localisation hypotheses.
keywords:
  - Lean
  - formal verification
  - quantum simulation
  - Coulomb Hamiltonian
  - plane waves
